SUMMARY:Odyssey
DESCRIPTION: \nOdyssey explores the human experience through Bharatanatyam\, weaving together compositions from various languages and composers\, spanning centuries of tradition and feeling. From the carefree days of childhood to the wisdom of age\, each of us walks a path shaped by emotion\, experience\, and meaning. What does it take to simply enjoy the ride? \nRevisiting the joy of childhood and the hope and love of youth\, the piece reflects honestly on how expectations\, ego\, and anxiety can pull us from what truly matters. It also showcases the beautiful moments of the journey too: the moments we let go\, open our hearts\, and rediscover life’s deeper purpose. \nSupported by: \n \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nA Journey Through Life\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScnf4gCigZLAPdcdYB9G8FKjpV7LKbi5mEnSngQM_qdeGMdGA/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Performers*: Ramya Ramnarayan\, K. Suresh\, Kalaiarasan Ramanathan\, M. Dhanamjayan\n*Event Categories*: Dance\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/odyssey/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Dance,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Thumbnail-9.jpg
